2026-07-27T10:01:35.5148026Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5148587Z i /tmp/Rtmp9h6O9u/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5148978Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5149438Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5149835Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5150726Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5151652Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:01:35.5152528Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
